  "details": "Hello,\nIt would be nice to have the option to have movement speed, jump height, and collisions of smaller/bigger avatars scale with their size.\nGoing too fast or too slow with bigger or smaller avatars can be quite jarring and break immersion.\nOf course, if such a thing was to be implemented, it should be disabled on game world. It would also be nice for world authors to disable that if they feel it is necessary.",
